@nsobid-CD57B23FA4BBAD65803D9788C01821EE

# The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild [01007EF00011E000] v1.9.0 - map shows koroks NOT found yet
# Vanilla already has a map icon for every korok (MapMgr pool +0x54138, from Static KorokLocation) and
# shows it only when the korok's flag is set (found). The korok icon class (vtable 0x1CDC870) updates
# its "draw" bit 0x80 in two methods (slots 11/12: 0xD7EE10, 0xD7EE84):
#     bit 0x80 = getBool(entry->handle) (0xD349D0)   ->  csel w9, w9, wzr, ne
# Flipping ne -> eq draws the icon while the korok is NOT found; it disappears once found.
# Koroks found before install are hidden too (same save flag). Only korok icons are affected.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

@enabled
00D7EE58 29019F1A
00D7EECC 29019F1A
@stop
